# Synthetic material-library stub, rewritten 2026-09-25 - NOT recovered original data.
# NeoForge's ObjLoader needs the mtllib to exist, AND takes each material's texture from its map_Kd line:
# a material with no map_Kd resolves to the missing-texture placeholder (magenta/black) no matter what
# StandaloneGeometryBakingContext is given. "#NAME" is a texture variable, bound by the renderer's own
# texture map (found in the first playtest: the Eldritch Warden's sonic-scream dome drew as a magenta cube).
newmtl Material__25
	map_Kd #Material__25
